 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- **Embedding (feature `embed`):** a page can show a board inside its own interface and keep the file itself, through
+  `globalThis.inkboardEmbed` (see [Embedding](docs/WEB.md#embedding-feature-embed)): mount on a canvas, take and replace the board,
+  change and save events, read-only, interface theme, no repaint while hidden. What the host page owns (New, Open, Save as, Join, the
+  presentation, the tab title…) is hidden. One board per page.
+- **Feature `net`** (on by default): a web build can leave out the network of shared sessions (`--no-default-features`); such a page
+  cannot join a session. The desktop application always has it.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Switching the system between light and dark no longer reverts the interface's colors until the board background changes: egui's theme
+  now follows the one Inkboard applies.
+
